{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tips:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo only shows the gameplay and mechanics of the game, which may differ from the official version;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo save data will not be inherited by the official version;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo playable content is approximately 8% of the official game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Storyline</strong>\uff1a<br>Players will take on the role of a warrior of the Red Church, led by the great leader Maxwell, to defeat powerful reactionary enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Size</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes a total of 6 main levels. Except for the main city level of Lonserf, each level is massive and features traditional Souls-like sandbox levels. The game includes a total of 10 boss battles and over 80 different AI combat encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voiceover &amp; Subtitles</strong>\uff1a<br>The game includes both Chinese and English voiceovers, with multi-language subtitles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong>\uff1a</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diverse enemy attack moves<br>Basic combo attacks, dangerous strikes, fatal attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u653b\u51fb\u5c55\u793a6-1.gif?t=1751537064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multi-layered enemy counter mechanisms and rewards<br>Mikiri counter, dodge, parry, gun counter, riposte</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u653b\u51fb\u5c55\u793a3-1.gif?t=1751537064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic and stirring historical adventure storyline<br>Multiple church factions compete for the right to lead Gurettvo, involving conspiracies, grudges, grand historical trends, and the victory of ideals and beliefs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/extras/\u5267\u60c5\u5c55\u793a-1.gif?t=1751537064\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various items, skills, and martial arts to &quot;abuse&quot; bosses<br>Items, skills, martial arts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333250?t=1751537064","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333250?t=1751537064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/8b1bea64ec5f0c1b1a85ba34f80dff90be78f55a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751537064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333250/8b1bea64ec5f0c1b1a85ba34f80dff90be78f55a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751537064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This game may contain content unsuitable for all ages, or inappropriate for workplace access: frequent violence or bloodshed, common adult content."},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3647930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tips:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Demo only shows the gameplay and mechanics of the game, which may differ from the official version;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo save data will not be inherited by t